xtMapHash":3884815714,"text":"おお！今回もコロンビーナを描いたんだな。","nextNodeIds":[760510308,760510309]},{"nodeId":760510308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":471481794,"text":"幸せそう…","nextNodeIds":[760510310]},{"nodeId":760510310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3619198266,"text":"これは…ナド・クライの森の中か？動物がたくさんいるな！","nextNodeIds":[760510311]},{"nodeId":760510311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":784516650,"text":"これは…たぶん、私が「霜月の子」を離れる前の絵だね。","nextNodeIds":[760510312]},{"nodeId":760510312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3413845810,"text":"わぁ、うらやましいぞ！本当に動物たちがこんな風に寄ってきてたのか？","nextNodeIds":[760510313]},{"nodeId":760510313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1796347754,"text":"うん。私はクーヴァキを放出してるから、そばにいると安心できるんだと思う。","nextNodeIds":[760510314]},{"nodeId":760510314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2374972386,"text":"へえ～！じゃあ、思う存分触っても逃げられないってことだよな！","nextNodeIds":[760510315]},{"nodeId":760510315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":732041058,"text":"うん…一番触り心地がいいのはモサモサアナグマかな。しっぽが大きくて、もふもふだから。","nextNodeIds":[760510316]},{"nodeId":760510316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":2985666714,"text":"ツノシカの首の毛もすごく柔らかいから、枕にすると気持ちいいよ。","nextNodeIds":[760510317]},{"nodeId":760510317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":521631994,"text":"キミたちはどっちが好き？","nextNodeIds":[760510318]},{"nodeId":760510318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":520466506,"text":"なんでオイラたちが触ったことある前提なんだよ…","nextNodeIds":[760510319]},{"nodeId":760510319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2362133450,"text":"でも、触れるとしたら…オイラはモサモサアナグマの尻尾がいいな。","nextNodeIds":[760510320]},{"nodeId":760510320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":2436178282,"text":"モサモサアナグマは人見知りな子が多いから、安全なところでじゃないと触らせてくれないの。","nextNodeIds":[760510321]},{"nodeId":760510321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":575769002,"text":"あっ…でも、パイモン、気をつけてね。","nextNodeIds":[760510322]},{"nodeId":760510322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1765227242,"text":"えっ？なんだなんだ？噛んできたりするのか？オ…オイラ、怒らせたりしないぞ。","nextNodeIds":[760510323]},{"nodeId":760510323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3810143330,"text":"ううん、上に気をつけて。","nextNodeIds":[760510324]},{"nodeId":760510324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":890178922,"text":"上？","nextNodeIds":[760510325]},{"nodeId":760510325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3793048018,"text":"うん、長羽トキは体が小さい動物を捕まえるの。何度も釘をさしたから、月霊は捕まえないでいてくれるけど。","nextNodeIds":[760510326]},{"nodeId":760510326,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3970963474,"text":"そういうのは初めて会ったときに言えよ！オイラが今日までさらわれてないのは奇跡だろ！","nextNodeIds":[760510327]},{"nodeId":760510327,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":643665050,"text":"うーん…わかった。今度長羽トキに会ったとき、言っておく。","nextNodeIds":[760510328]},{"nodeId":760510328,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":143404434,"text":"い、今言ってきてくれよ。オイラ、怖くてここから出られないぞ…","nextNodeIds":[760510329]},{"nodeId":760510329,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":352679050,"text":"パイモンの事はどう伝えたらいい？","nextNodeIds":[760510330,760510332,760510334]},{"nodeId":760510330,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4155530882,"text":"最高の仲間。","nextNodeIds":[760510331]},{"nodeId":760510331,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3667765162,"text":"そうそう、最高の仲間をさらうなんてダメだからな！","nextNodeIds":[760510336]},{"nodeId":760510336,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15702,"speakerName":"メイラ","textMapHash":3727619730,"text":"！！","nextNodeIds":[760510337]},{"nodeId":760510337,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":416786546,"text":"この子…パイモンが長羽トキにさらわれる場面が描きたくなっちゃったみたい。","nextNodeIds":[760510338]},{"nodeId":760510338,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4176708674,"text":"そんな場面描かなくていいぞ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":760510332,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4106949402,"text":"最高のガイド。","nextNodeIds":[760510333]},{"nodeId":760510333,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2877132834,"text":"うっ…覚えててくれて嬉しいけど、長羽トキに「ガイド」なんて言ってもわからないだろ…","nextNodeIds":[760510336]},{"nodeId":760510334,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":748749746,"text":"食べるとお腹を壊すもの。","nextNodeIds":[760510335]},{"nodeId":760510335,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1257377434,"text":"オイラはそもそも食べものじゃないぞ！長羽トキが「へえ、食べてみよう」って思ったらどうするんだよ！","nextNodeIds":[760510336]},{"nodeId":760510309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":611592098,"text":"楽しそう…","nextNodeIds":[760510310]}]},{"talkId":7605104,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrp